{"title":"Titanium Mace","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Weapon Smithing Lv 54)</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 40 · STR 100 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>Skill needed</h2><p>Wielding it takes the <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\"><b>Mace</b> weapon skill</a>. No class starts with it. To learn it, finish the quest <b><a href=\"#/guide/quest-warrior-mace-the-broken-hammers\">The Broken Hammers</a></b> (Hester Bell near Rustpick Mine, warriors, level 11): free, and you keep the skill for good.</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\">Weapon skills &amp; specials</a> for how the skill levels and what it unlocks.</p>\n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Weapon Smithing at level 54 <span class=\"muted\">(6075 XP)</span> from 6× <a href=\"#/item/titanium-bar\">Titanium Bar</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/weapon-smithing\">Weapon smithing</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/titanium-mace\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/titanium-mace?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/titanium-mace?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/titanium-mace?q=shoddy\">Shoddy</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/titanium-mace?q=ordinary\">Ordinary</a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/titanium-mace?q=good\">Good</a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/titanium-mace?q=excellent\">Excellent</a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/titanium-mace?q=superior\">Superior</a><a class=\"q-chip on q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/titanium-mace?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"titanium-mace\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"destruction\">Destruction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"burn\">Flame</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"freeze\">Freezing</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"shock\">Storm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"corrode\">Corrosion</button></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. Damage below is the weapon alone, before your stats and enchantments.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th>vs Ordinary</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/titanium-mace?q=inferior\" title=\"Show it at Inferior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-inferior\" src=\"data/img/gen/49d32876bb328bdb684d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></td><td>-30%</td><td>7.3–47.7 damage</td><td>-11.8 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/titanium-mace?q=crude\" title=\"Show it at Crude\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-crude\" src=\"data/img/gen/49d32876bb328bdb684d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></td><td>-20%</td><td>8.4–54.5 damage</td><td>-7.9 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/titanium-mace?q=shoddy\" title=\"Show it at Shoddy\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-shoddy\" src=\"data/img/gen/49d32876bb328bdb684d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></td><td>-10%</td><td>9.4–61.3 damage</td><td>-3.9 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/titanium-mace?q=ordinary\" title=\"Show it at Ordinary\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/gen/49d32876bb328bdb684d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></td><td>0%</td><td>10.5–68.1 damage</td><td>0 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/titanium-mace?q=good\" title=\"Show it at Good\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-good\" src=\"data/img/gen/49d32876bb328bdb684d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-good\">Good</span></td><td>+10%</td><td>11.5–74.9 damage</td><td>+3.9 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/titanium-mace?q=excellent\" title=\"Show it at Excellent\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-excellent\" src=\"data/img/gen/49d32876bb328bdb684d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span></td><td>+22%</td><td>12.8–83.1 damage</td><td>+8.6 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/titanium-mace?q=superior\" title=\"Show it at Superior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-superior\" src=\"data/img/gen/49d32876bb328bdb684d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span></td><td>+30%</td><td>13.6–88.5 damage</td><td>+11.8 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/item/titanium-mace?q=flawless\" title=\"Show it at Flawless\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-flawless\" src=\"data/img/gen/49d32876bb328bdb684d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">Flawless</span></td><td>+38%</td><td>14.5–94 damage</td><td>+14.9 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <h2>Getting Flawless ones</h2>\n      <p><b>Crafting</b> (Weapon Smithing 54): the higher above 54 you are, the better the odds, up to +30. <a href=\"#/calc-quality\" data-qe=\"titanium-mace\">Plan it on Quality &amp; enchanting</a></p>\n        <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table\"><thead><tr><th>Your level</th><th><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-good\">Good</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">Flawless</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>54 <span class=\"muted\">(+0)</span></td><td>1.5%</td><td>4.0%</td><td>19.1%</td><td>56.2%</td><td>16.2%</td><td>2.9%</td><td>0.2%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>59 <span class=\"muted\">(+5)</span></td><td>0.5%</td><td>2.4%</td><td>14.2%</td><td>55.7%</td><td>21.4%</td><td>5.1%</td><td>0.7%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>64 <span class=\"muted\">(+10)</span></td><td>0.1%</td><td>1.2%</td><td>10.0%</td><td>52.7%</td><td>26.4%</td><td>7.8%</td><td>1.7%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>69 <span class=\"muted\">(+15)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.4%</td><td>6.6%</td><td>47.5%</td><td>30.8%</td><td>11.1%</td><td>3.5%</td><td>0.1%</td></tr><tr><td>74 <span class=\"muted\">(+20)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.1%</td><td>3.9%</td><td>40.8%</td><td>33.7%</td><td>15.1%</td><td>5.9%</td><td>0.6%</td></tr><tr><td>77 <span class=\"muted\">(+23)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>2.8%</td><td>36.3%</td><td>34.5%</td><td>17.5%</td><td>7.8%</td><td>1.2%</td></tr><tr><td>79 <span class=\"muted\">(+25)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>2.0%</td><td>33.3%</td><td>35.0%</td><td>19.1%</td><td>9.0%</td><td>1.6%</td></tr><tr><td>84 <span class=\"muted\">(+30)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.8%</td><td>25.7%</td><td>34.7%</td><td>22.7%</td><td>12.8%</td><td>3.3%</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      <p><b>Monster drops</b>: ordinary monsters and chests give at most Excellent; elites give only Excellent, Superior or Flawless (official guide).</p>\n      <p class=\"muted\">No Flawless drops of it recorded yet.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/iron-mace\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/c85277c8